<title>GERMANY: GERMAN DATA DUE -- December M3 data due shortly.</title>
<headline>GERMAN DATA DUE -- December M3 data due shortly.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bundesbank said it would release German M3 money supply data for December shortly.</p>
<p>M3 grew at an annualised rate of eight percent in November the Bundesbank said.</p>
<p>The Bundesbank's target range for 1996 M3 money supply growth was four percent to seven percent. For 1997, it has set a corridor of 3-1/2 to 6-1/2 percent.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom +49 69 756525</p>
